  "releaseNotes": "'# [9.6.0](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v9.5.0...v9.6.0) (2025-05-23)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **deps:** update dependencies to 4.14.0 ([#887](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/887)) ([767a8d7](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/767a8d7ddead8b9cfdc681ead62d87aa8ef4de36))\n* **deps:** update dependencies to 9.0.5 ([#884](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/884)) ([1f78bb6](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/1f78bb635e5e4caa92b89811d40c1d0382a891f6))\n* **deps:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.10.0.116381 ([#888](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/888)) ([fbedc70](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/fbedc7087a22da47848d720c79d6af5de94b118f))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* add namespace to logging scope and make ResourceWatcher more extensible ([#889](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/889)) ([0e65443](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/0e6544332ff5c81faeaca429addc57024c2cb1f2))\n\n\n\n'",
